---
description: Protects the automatic prompt/response capture in .agent-logs/
alwaysApply: true
---

`.agent-logs/` is written automatically by the hooks in `.cursor/hooks.json`
(`beforeSubmitPrompt`, `afterAgentResponse`, `stop` -> `.cursor/hooks/capture.py`).

- Never edit, reformat, summarise, truncate, or delete an existing entry in `.agent-logs/`.
  Wrong answers and dead ends stay in the log exactly as they were recorded.
- Never add `.agent-logs/` to `.gitignore`. It is committed and ships with the repo.
- Commit log files as you go, alongside the code from the same turn, not in one dump at the end.
